  "instructions": [
    "Cut the onion and mince the garlic and set aside.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the bamboo steamer over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the green olives, artichoke hearts, lemon juice, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the shredded Gouda cheese and stir until melted and well combined.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
